    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Red mustard mizuna is a nutrient-dense, peppery Japanese green packed with vitamins A, C, and K, along with antioxidants like anthocyanins (in the red variety) and&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=glucosinolates&amp;newwindow=1&amp;rlz=1CAVNCX_enUS1049US1049&amp;biw=1366&amp;bih=599&amp;sca_esv=89aaa52b873f06b6&amp;sxsrf=ANbL-n5cjEMtt4pkXhGt6XMTDb2-JxyJ0g%3A1770330473795&amp;ei=aRmFaZGhMI650PEP4q6SgAo&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiOlZSxs8OSAxUQCTQIHQK3FuUQgK4QegQIARAB&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=red+mustard+mizuna+benefits&amp;gs_lp=Egxnd3Mtd2l6LXNlcnAiG3JlZCBtdXN0YXJkIG1penVuYSBiZW5lZml0czIIEAAYgAQYogQyBRAAGO8FMggQABiABBiiBDIIEAAYgAQYogRI0SBQ5ANYhRhwAXgBkAEAmAGsAaAB_wqqAQQxMC40uAEDyAEA-AEBmAIPoALvDMICChAAGLADGNYEGEfCAgYQABgHGB7CAggQABgHGAgYHsICCBAAGAUYBxgewgILEAAYgAQYhgMYigXCAgUQABiABMICBhAAGAUYHsICBhAAGAgYHsICCBAAGKIEGIkFwgIKECEYoAEYwwQYCsICCBAhGKABGMMEmAMAiAYBkAYIkgcDNy44oAeTTrIHAzYuOLgHzQzCBwowLjEuMi4xMC4yyAetAYAIAA&amp;sclient=gws-wiz-serp&amp;mstk=AUtExfBsZXjUSfBpbtQul0peGKSHP1Bmu3UHmZtekCZcNcke6Juf1e2GMP72NxQ_8Gj51j5-rBtpE36isKJglX7Z6JGPHSDkTkSH2xssu6KfC8M5qRkvF3k-rXBh_M8hKps4M6YiAd8EeqtIULLkaQJzpklL5t-IvaEsAZy2emkeI4xuzJ0ovfEyvffVDd16yPdtSlatxo90bMGamN5B3SMJ6CsCYXW3JVbLuy9oYX3PTVawxBeIv8OaqwfuRmE8FnB8PbNy7maZitm7VkoodJxsNJ2w&amp;csui=3\" class=\"lexical-text-editor--link\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">glucosinolates</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">. It&nbsp;boosts immune function, strengthens bone health, reduces inflammation, and supports eye health. Low in calories, it is ideal for salads, stir-fries, and soups.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grown by: Groundwork Organic Farm</span></p>",
